<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.3 Ablations ‣ 5 TruthV: Training-free Truthfulness Detection via Value Vectors in LLM ‣ Training-free Truthfulness Detection via Value Vectors in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Effect of activation pattern.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 TruthV: Training-free Truthfulness Detection via Value Vectors in LLM ‣ Training-free Truthfulness Detection via Value Vectors in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Analysis</span></a>
