<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS4.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5.4 Analysis ‣ 5 TruthV: Training-free Truthfulness Detection via Value Vectors in LLM ‣ Training-free Truthfulness Detection via Value Vectors in LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Generalization ability of truthfulness-related value vectors.</span></a></li>
